@NutritionService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5290

### 1. Get current nutrition preference (unconfigured returns prompt)
GET {{NutritionService_HostAddress}}/api/nutrition/preferences/me
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Set nutrition goal to Maintain (FIT-162) - returns { success: true, message: "..." }
PUT {{NutritionService_HostAddress}}/api/nutrition/preferences/me
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "goal": "Maintain"
}

###

### 3. Get current nutrition preference after setting (FIT-163)
GET {{NutritionService_HostAddress}}/api/nutrition/preferences/me
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Update nutrition goal to GradualLoss
PUT {{NutritionService_HostAddress}}/api/nutrition/preferences/me
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "goal": "GradualLoss"
}

###

### 5. Update nutrition goal to GradualGain with custom X-User-Id header
PUT {{NutritionService_HostAddress}}/api/nutrition/preferences/me
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

{
  "goal": "GradualGain"
}

###

### 6. Get nutrition preference for custom user via X-User-Id header
GET {{NutritionService_HostAddress}}/api/nutrition/preferences/me
Accept: application/json
X-User-Id: 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

###

### 7. Test Validation - Invalid Goal
PUT {{NutritionService_HostAddress}}/api/nutrition/preferences/me
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "goal": 999
}

###

### 8. Test POST alias endpoint
POST {{NutritionService_HostAddress}}/api/nutrition/preferences
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "goal": "Maintain"
}

###

###############################################################################
# MEAL CATALOG MANAGEMENT & DISCOVERY (NT-03)
###############################################################################

### 8. Browse active meals (paginated, empty/initial catalog)
GET {{NutritionService_HostAddress}}/api/nutrition/meals?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

###

### 9. Create a Meal (Admin) - Breakfast (returns 201 Created with { id: "guid" })
POST {{NutritionService_HostAddress}}/api/nutrition/meals
Content-Type: application/json
X-Role: Admin

{
  "name": "Oatmeal with Blueberries and Whey Protein",
  "type": "Breakfast",
  "calories": 420,
  "proteinGrams": 32.5
}

###

### 10. Create a Meal (Admin) - Lunch
POST {{NutritionService_HostAddress}}/api/nutrition/meals
Content-Type: application/json
X-Role: Admin

{
  "name": "Grilled Chicken Breast with Brown Rice",
  "type": "Lunch",
  "calories": 580,
  "proteinGrams": 48.0
}

###

### 11. Create a Meal (Admin) - Snack
POST {{NutritionService_HostAddress}}/api/nutrition/meals
Content-Type: application/json
X-Role: Admin

{
  "name": "Greek Yogurt with Almonds",
  "type": "Snack",
  "calories": 250,
  "proteinGrams": 22.0
}

###

### 12. Create a Meal Validation Failure - Negative Calories and Protein
POST {{NutritionService_HostAddress}}/api/nutrition/meals
Content-Type: application/json
X-Role: Admin

{
  "name": "Invalid Meal",
  "type": "Dinner",
  "calories": -100,
  "proteinGrams": -5.0
}

###

### 13. Create a Meal Validation Failure - Empty Name and Invalid Type
POST {{NutritionService_HostAddress}}/api/nutrition/meals
Content-Type: application/json
X-Role: Admin

{
  "name": "",
  "type": "InvalidMealType",
  "calories": 300,
  "proteinGrams": 20.0
}

###

### 14. Browse active meals with Search query
GET {{NutritionService_HostAddress}}/api/nutrition/meals?search=Chicken&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

###

### 15. Browse active meals filtered by MealType
GET {{NutritionService_HostAddress}}/api/nutrition/meals?type=Breakfast&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

###

### 16. Get Meal by Id (Replace GUID with an actual meal ID from create response)
@SampleMealId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{NutritionService_HostAddress}}/api/nutrition/meals/{{SampleMealId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 17. Update Meal details (Admin) - returns 200 OK with { success: true, message: "..." }
PUT {{NutritionService_HostAddress}}/api/nutrition/meals/{{SampleMealId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Role: Admin

{
  "name": "Grilled Chicken Breast with Quinoa and Steamed Veggies",
  "type": "Lunch",
  "calories": 540,
  "proteinGrams": 50.0
}

###

### 18. Soft-deactivate Meal (Admin) - returns 204 NoContent
DELETE {{NutritionService_HostAddress}}/api/nutrition/meals/{{SampleMealId}}
X-Role: Admin

###

### 19. Verify deactivated meal is excluded from Browse
GET {{NutritionService_HostAddress}}/api/nutrition/meals
Accept: application/json

###
